 "text": "You want to add collagen to your wellness routine but don't want another powder to mix every morning. That's what makes this You Theory Liquid Collagen interesting. It comes in these little ready-to-drink packets. No blender, no scooping, and no mixing. Each serving contains 5,000 milligrams of collagen peptides, and you don't even need water. It's designed to support your beauty and wellness routine from within, and the individual packets make it easy to take with you when you're on the go. Check it out for your daily routine.",
